<!--
    Adaptive-icon foreground (2026 refresh).

    Changes from the 2018 original:
      - art scaled to 95% (outer group, pivoted on the viewport centre) so it sits a
        little further inside the adaptive-icon safe zone and reads better once a
        launcher applies its mask
      - flat #00675b fill -> a subtle teal gradient (light top-left to deep
        bottom-right), the gentle depth cue current Material icons use

    Geometry note: the viewport is 83.12727 square and the artwork is offset by the
    inner group's translate — that's the 2018 export from Shape Shifter, left intact.
    The monochrome/themed layer is a separate file (ic_launcher_monochrome.xml): the
    system tints that one flat, so it must not carry a gradient.
-->
